 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "The 2022 World Cup final: Argentina against France, three-all, then Argentina won on penalties.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 7.16
  },
  {
   "text": "Argentina in a four-three-three, France in a four-two-three-one.",
   "start": 8.1,
   "end": 11.23
  },
  {
   "text": "In the first forty minutes, Argentina completed two hundred and thirty passes to France's one hundred and sixteen.",
   "start": 11.92,
   "end": 17.908
  },
  {
   "text": "By the seventy-eighth minute, Argentina had ten shots.",
   "start": 18.2,
   "end": 21.1
  },
  {
   "text": "France had two, the first in the sixty-seventh minute.",
   "start": 21.56,
   "end": 24.47
  },
  {
   "text": "Then France scored in the seventy-ninth minute, and again in the eightieth.",
   "start": 24.86,
   "end": 28.56
  },
  {
   "text": "Over the whole match, expected goals ended nearly level: two point eight to two point three.",
   "start": 29.1,
   "end": 34.165
  },
  {
   "text": "Argentina built the lead.",
   "start": 34.58,
   "end": 35.58
  },
  {
   "text": "France built the comeback.",
   "start": 36.34,
   "end": 37.34
  }
 ]
